}

**Example:**
```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <list>

int main() {
    std::list<char> coll = {'a', 'b', 'c', 'd'};
    // Declare a const_iterator to iterate over the list without modifying elements
    std::list<char>::const_iterator pos;
