void forward_wrapper(T&& arg) {
    real_function(std::forward<T>(arg));
}
```

**Compiler optimizations:**
- **RVO (Return Value Optimization)**: Eliminates copy/move when returning by value
- **NRVO (Named RVO)**: RVO for named variables
- **Copy elision**: C++17 guarantees elision in some cases

**When NOT to use std::move:**
```cpp
